WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Treasure Island

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.420
<i>This is it!
I'm here!</i>

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:36.710
<i>I'm going to cut the moorings on the Hispaniola.</i>

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.910
Hands, what have you been looking at?

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:51.820
Well?

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.990
Hey.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.700
I don't see anything.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.420
I have a bad feeling.

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:07.670
I feel that something's
going to happen tonight.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:21.550
<i>If I cut the moorings, the Hispaniola will drift and we won't have to worry about their cannons.</i>

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:34.690
Alright, only one left...

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.620
Fifteen men...

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:42.100
...on a dead man's chest!

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:47.280
Yo-ho-ho!
...and a bottle of rum!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:49.330
Drink and...

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:53.800
...the devil had done for the rest!

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:04.890
Yo-ho-ho!

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.900
Hey, O'Brien!

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.830
Go and see what happened!

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.040
The ship's swaying.

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:27.000
We could be drifting.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.620
Don't be ridiculous.
We're anchored solid.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.260
We can't be drifting away.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.500
<i>That's it!
I did it!</i>

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.390
<i>I've cut their moorings!</i>

