00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:17.350
Many of us

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.350
minna mada shiranai

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.350
Still don't know of

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:24.100
fushigi na hiru to yoru toga

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:24.100
The days and nights full of mystery

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.600
matte iru darou

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.600
That await us there

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.110
itsumo shinji you

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.110
We must always have trust

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.360
magokoro wo

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.360
And be sincere

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:39.620
yuuki wo mune ni susumou yo

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:39.620
And have courage in our hearts to move forward

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.750
tade hitotsu no

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.750
I only...

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:46.170
akogare dake wa

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:46.170
...have one desire

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.460
doko no dare ni mo

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.460
And no one...

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:55.170
kese wa shinai sa

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:55.170
...will ever take it away

