doko no dare ni mo

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.350
And no one...

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:14.280
kese wa shinai sa

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:14.280
...will ever take it away

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:25.490
episode

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:25.490
Don't Underestimate Me,
\h            I'm Not a Kid

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:23.420
I don't like this...

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.880
Hey, don't you feel that?

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.800
We're drifting!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.720
I'm sure of it!

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.190
That's enough, Hands!

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:34.680
It's shallow here.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.930
We're just feeling the waves, is all.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.570
Don't worry about a few ripples.

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.890
O'Brien!
Who do you take me for?

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.530
I'd like to remind you that I'm the quartermaster!

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:49.700
Shut up!

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:54.040
Are you implying that I don't know my own job, huh?!

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:59.130
Shut up!
I'd like some peace and quiet.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.590
What are you doing?!

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.590
I just want some silence.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.090
You guys...
Looks like you're having fun.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:29.620
Enjoy yourself.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.870
That's it, keep drifting!
Further and further!

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.910
By sunrise we'll be offshore!

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:47.320
Silver's gonna be very surprised! That'll teach him!

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:31.230
I was nearly squished!

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:42.860
Th-This is what I was afraid of!
The ship has run aground!

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:46.320
Damn, I've failed!
I've failed big time!

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:51.280
See, something IS wrong!
Idiots!

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:08.430
Benbow!

00:08:09.970 --> 00:08:11.600
Damn it all...

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:20.770
Hell, I can't see anything with this fog.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.650
I messed up...

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:39.120
I'm done for!
He'll notice!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.160
Hands!

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:47.170
What is it? Have you found anything strange?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.250
Well, "quartermaster" Hands?

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:55.680
The ship seems anchored solid.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.110
Understand?
I'm counting on you, Benbow.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.610
In any case, Hands, my old friend...

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:05.880
It can't be easy being the quartermaster.

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:08.610
You've got your responsibilities and can't afford any mistakes.

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:16.740
Yeah, you're really a sight to see.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.520
Keep going, you're almost there.

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:22.750
Good job, Benbow.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:26.210
Where was I?
Guess I'll return to my drink...

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:30.670
Wait a second, O'Brien.
You had something to say to me?

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:32.930
Not really.

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.600
If you have a complaint,
be clear about it!

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.930
Don't get all riled up, Hands.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.650
You're a coward.

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:45.360
You're a quartermaster like Silver was,
but the similarity stops there!

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:58.230
Listen to me, O'Brien! I've had
enough of your insubordination!

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.450
Do as you're ordered!

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:05.410
Or else, I'll slit your throat for real next time!

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:07.090
U-Understood...

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:19.510
Man, my little mission turned out
to be a complete failure.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.870
What are we going to do Benbow?

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.930
Really, what CAN I do?

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.410
Of course, the pirate flag!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:46.260
<i>While I'm here, I'm going to take their flag.</i>

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.960
<i>This pirate flag...</i>

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.760
<i>This blood-stained pirate flag...</i>

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.840
<i>I can't let it fly on the mast
of the Hispaniola!</i>

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.020
Damn you...

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:15.900
I'll teach that bastard Hands to play captain.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.690
Who does he think he is?

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:32.040
Damn, I don't like this one bit...

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:52.610
Hey, Flint.

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:54.670
It might be because of the fog,

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:59.560
but don't you think that the Hispaniola is rather far from shore?

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:04.350
Yeah, it's definitely the fog.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:10.000
You got it Benbow?
Keep your eyes open.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.540
Alright...

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:30.460
This cursed fog's making me depressed.
Damn it...

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:45.070
That's odd...

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.750
I swear I just saw someone climbing the mast.

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:49.950
Very strange...
Was I dreaming?

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:58.680
Now what?!
What was that?

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:07.590
Who's there!?

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:08.760
Who goes there!?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.220
Show yourself!

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:12.820
Damn...

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:15.390
Show yourself!

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:24.110
Come on, nearly there.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.170
I'm sure I saw someone up there.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.950
I'm telling you.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:37.330
A coward like Hands doesn't
deserve to be quartermaster!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:43.040
O-O'Brien, Lean Dog!

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:45.010
Go take a look on deck!

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:51.310
O'Brien!
Lean Dog!

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:55.270
If we leave the ship to Hands any longer,
we're headed for disaster.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:58.230
That's why we need to talk, Lean Dog.

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:04.150
I've finished it.
It's magnificent!

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:07.260
Cute, isn't it?

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.370
Look at it!

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.160
Yo, Lean Dog,

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.130
why are you acting so strange?

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.050
Lean Dog...

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.080
What do you say, Lean Dog?

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.140
Are you going to help me deal with him?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:34.680
Well?

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:51.120
L-Lean Dog, you bastard!
Have you gone mad?!

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:56.080
I'm going... I'm going to slit your pretty little throat.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.760
Iron-Arms.
Iron-Arms!

00:14:57.760 --> 00:15:01.420
Wake up, Iron-Arms!
Where are O'Brien and Lean Dog?

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.170
A drink...

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.590
Get me a drink!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:06.550
You good for nothing!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:10.340
S-S-Stop, Lean Dog!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.760
O'Brien... Lean Dog!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:18.960
Where are you?!

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.860
<i>That's it...</i>

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.460
<i>Come on, almost there...</i>

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.950
Your neck...
Let's see your pretty neck!

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:51.230
That's it, I've done it!
I've stolen their flag!

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:52.800
That'll teach you!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:55.350
This thing...
If it wasn't for this...!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.810
Go on!
Sink to the bottom of the ocean!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:15.950
Benbow!

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:17.830
Benbow!

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:19.710
Benbow!

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:22.460
Where has Benbow gone?

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:33.970
We'll stay hidden here for a while, then escape when we can.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.880
Hey, O'Brien...
Lean Dog!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:56.290
What the hell's goin' on?!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.300
They're infighting!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.080
They're insane...
They're all insane!

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:34.380
Who's there?
Who said that?!

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:35.340
Get down!

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:38.780
Come out...
Show yourself!

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.300
Hands...

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.030
Hey Hands, do you have any booze?

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:48.940
H-Hey...

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:49.690
Damn...

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.570
Hey, Lean Dog, do you have any booze?

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:40.900
It hurts...
It hurts bad, Mama.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:43.890
I'm in pain.
I-It hurts, Mama...

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:49.380
GO DIE ALREADY!

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:58.340
It hurts.
It hurts...

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:01.390
Mama, it's Treasure Island!

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:06.200
I just... need to have a drink.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:10.980
Ouch, that hurt!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:14.810
You're going to die!
You're dead!

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:13.780
They're all dead...

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:16.490
That's good.
They got what they deserved.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:20.460
They're nothing but dirty pirates!
I hope that they all die!

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:33.360
Captain Silver, why are you returning to the ship?

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:37.270
Well, I'm a bit worried about the ship.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:41.280
It's just a hunch...

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.240
A storm's coming.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:20.860
<i>S-Silver!</i>

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:31.620
To      be        continued

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:37.660
shiokaze yo omae mo

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:37.660
Hey sea breeze

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:43.470
tomodachi naraba tsutaete

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:43.470
If you're my friend then carry

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:49.680
furusato ni nokoshite kita

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:49.680
To my home that I've left behind

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:55.120
natsukashii haha ni hitokoto

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:55.120
A word to my dear mother

00:22:55.120 --> 00:23:00.530
boku wa genki de yattemasu

00:22:55.120 --> 00:23:00.530
Tell her that I'm doing fine

00:23:00.530 --> 00:23:05.990
kaban ippai no

00:23:00.530 --> 00:23:05.990
And that my bag filled

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:11.620
nozomi to yume to takaramono

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:11.620
With hopes, dreams and treasures

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:17.480
kakaete kaeritai

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:17.480
Will be brought back

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:24.070
yuuyake wo senaka ni

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:24.070
The sunset on my back

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:29.960
kamome wo kata ni tomarasete

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:29.960
And a seagull perched on my shoulder

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:39.680
boku wa fukimasu kuchibue wo

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:39.680
I blow out a whistle

00:23:44.840 --> 00:23:46.320
Death doesn't scare me.

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.690
But I don't want to die for nothing!

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:53.820
Suddenly, I find myself facing a storm alongside the treacherous Silver.

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:57.450
I'm reminded of the time when we were friends.

00:23:58.220 --> 00:24:02.080
Suddenly, to both our surprise, it seems that we are not alone.

00:24:02.850 --> 00:24:06.410
Next time on Treasure Island:
"Hands is Supposed to be Dead"

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:08.610
No matter what,
an enemy stays an enemy.

